cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Toolkit on Deterministic and Probabilistic Record Linkage
  for the Production of Official Statistics
message: Please cite this toolkit if you use it in your work.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Nicolas
    family-names: Libuy
  - name: United Nations Statistics Division
repository-code: https://github.com/NicolasLibuy/record-linkage-toolkit
url: https://nicolaslibuy.github.io/record-linkage-toolkit
abstract: >-
  A practical toolkit for national statistical offices on deterministic and
  probabilistic record linkage, covering data readiness, pseudonymisation,
  linkage design, blocking, Fellegi-Sunter estimation with Splink, threshold
  selection, clustering, quality evaluation and documentation. Prepared under
  the UNSD Data for Now initiative.
license: CC-BY-4.0
